- Literal funding clocks, raw rates and reported intervals match separately pinned saved RAW_EVENTS. No clock rounding or rate scaling.
- Zero sourceguard violations, internal transfers, topups, new capital and debt forgiveness. BASE27 fees and execution costs retained.
