- Actual saved274/365/366-day headers verified. Prior independently rerun exact default-writer tests cover full-length C/F decoding and reject calendar/row/header/payload corruption.

## Limits
Adaptive DEV research. Partial2021 is not annualized. Annual wallets are fresh and not compounded. Nominal tier ceilings do not establish equal realized risk. Source arrival, raw funding units, native venue/filter/risk-tier/liquidation and source-gap marks are not certified.

